#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:6
msgid "UniSDK Introduction"
msgstr "UniSDK 简介"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:8
msgid "Telink Semiconductor"
msgstr "泰凌微电子（Telink Semiconductor）"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:10
msgid ""
"Telink Semiconductor is a company focused on designing low-power wireless"
" connectivity chips, providing complete chip solutions covering protocols"
" such as BLE, Zigbee, Thread, and Matter. Telink chips are widely used in"
" smart homes, wearable devices, IoT sensors, and other scenarios."
msgstr ""
"泰凌微电子是一家专注于设计低功耗无线连接芯片的公司，提供涵盖 BLE、Zigbee、"
"Thread 和 Matter 等协议的完整芯片解决方案。泰凌芯片广泛应用于智能家居、可穿戴设备、"
"物联网传感器等场景。"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:12
msgid "UniSDK Core Features and Advantages"
msgstr "UniSDK 核心功能与优势"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:14
msgid ""
"UniSDK (Unified Software Development Kit) provides a unified software "
"development platform for the full range of Telink chips. The core "
"advantages include:"
msgstr ""
"UniSDK（统一软件开发套件）为泰凌全系列芯片提供统一的软件开发平台。"
"其核心优势包括："

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:16
msgid "Unified Development Experience"
msgstr "统一的开发体验"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:18
msgid ""
"**One Codebase, Multi-Chip Adaptation**: Based on a unified API layer and"
" HAL abstraction, application code can seamlessly migrate between "
"different Telink chips"
msgstr ""
"**一套代码，多芯片适配**：基于统一的 API 层和 HAL 抽象层，应用程序代码可"
"在不同泰凌芯片之间无缝迁移"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:19
msgid ""
"**Unified Build System**: All chip families share the same CMake + "
"Kconfig build infrastructure"
msgstr ""
"**统一构建系统**：所有芯片系列共用同一套 CMake + Kconfig 构建基础设施"

#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:21
msgid "Modern Build System"
