#: ../../source/introduction/index.md:35
msgid ""
"Provides GPIO, UART, I2C, SPI, ADC, DMA, Watchdog, Timer, and other full-"
"range peripheral drivers, encapsulating underlying hardware differences "
"with a unified API."
